    "title": "Last Day! Wendy's 2026 Frosty Key Tag Unlocks Free Frosty for One Year",
    "text": "Tag, you’re it! This annual offer from Wendy’s definitely won’t leave bargain hunters in the cold…well, err, maybe just “a little Frosty”. If you enjoy a little sweet treat with your meal (or just as a snack), you’ll definitely want to grab one of the chain’s popular Frosty Key Tags. The little tag is the key to a year’s worth of cool treats at no cost. A small investment (for a good cause) for a sweet payoff in 2026. Image: Wendy’s Purchase a cool 2026 Frosty Key Tag for just $3 and enjoy a FREE Jr. Frosty with any purchase every time you visit Wendy’s — from February 2 to December 31, 2026. All you have to do is flash your key tag at participating locations. Limit one per transaction, per visit, per key tag. The key tags are available for purchase from February 2 to April 5, 2026 (while supplies last), in-restaurant, via the app and in bulk online. There are three ways to purchase a Wendy’s Frosty Key Tag: In-Restaurant: Simply add a Frosty Key Tag to your order in-restaurant. Wendy’s App: Opt for a digital version to instantly receive your Frosty Key Tag as a mobile offer, which can be applied to future mobile orders and added to your Wendy’s Rewards card for in-restaurant scanning. OR Purchase a physical Frosty Key Tag with any in-app order. Online: If you’re in need of lots of key tags for work or school, purchase Frosty Key Tags in bulk on the Dave Thomas Foundation for Adoption site. Consider buying one for each family member for maximum savings. The tag pays for itself in just a few visits. If you frequent Wendy’s often, you’ll definitely enjoy lots of sweet savings before ringing in 2027. Coolest of all, the proceeds benefit an important cause: Helping kids find a good, loving family to call home. Ninety percent of the proceeds from the sale of the tags goes to the Dave Thomas Foundation for Adoption. The key tags often sell out quickly, so don’t wait too long to get one. Otherwise, you really will be left in the cold on this deal! Hungry for more food deals? Thursday, April 16, 2026 Friday, April 17, 2026 Saturday, April 18, 2026 Sunday, April 19, 2026 Monday, April 20, 2026 Tuesday, April 21, 2026 Wednesday, April 22, 2026 Wendy’s – Multiple Locations CO",
